{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216070","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1721607001:1":{"text":"다들 에이르랑 친하게 지내도록!","source_cn":"你们几个可以陪艾尔了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x498BB7F47F6E6DC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1721607002:0":{"text":"호른, 여기 근위대 주둔지 맞아?","source_cn":"呼伦，这还是守备军驻地吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BE7288202440BAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721607003:0":{"text":"응? 여기 귀족 영애의 침실 아니었어?","source_cn":"我还以为是哪个贵族小姐的卧室！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF982B19FE203FE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721607004:1":{"text":"하하하하! 호른, 그런 말 하지 마. 근데 뭐... 진짜 귀족 영애가 맞긴 하잖아?","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈！呼伦，你别这么说。毕竟人家可是正牌的贵族小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE395A567A69663DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721607005:1":{"text":"활이나 만지작거리며 사는 게 얼마나 힘들겠어. 이런 유치한 짓이라도 해야 좀 낫겠지.","source_cn":"摆弄弓箭的日子太苦了，肯定得玩点童趣的东西找找安慰嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE88DFF7D3C4497C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721607006:1":{"text":"인형 놀이? 이런 건 세 살짜리나 갖고 노는 거 아닌가?","source_cn":"安慰玩偶嘛？这种软趴趴的东西，三岁小孩才玩吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B15E3565B1D76EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721607007:1":{"text":"지금은 자유 시간이야. 내 개인 물품에 간섭하지 말도록 해.","source_cn":"现在是自由活动时间。我的私人物品与你们无关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E219859AF761DE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721607008:1":{"text":"그렇게 한가하면 완전군장하고 주둔지 두 바퀴 뛰게 해 줄까?","source_cn":"如果太闲，我不介意让你们加两组负重跑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2F31B5BBAB00CF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721607009:2":{"text":"에이, 귀네스 분대장님. 농담이에요~ 그냥... 이게 근위대 주둔지랑 좀 안 어울린다고 생각해서 말이죠.","source_cn":"别这么严肃嘛，格温妮丝队长。我们只是觉得……这东西和守...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9F704B0741C0ED9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721607010:1":{"text":"근위대는 군인이고 전사 아닙니까. 진짜 군인은 저희처럼 강인하고 건장한 사람들이지, 이런 인형 놀이를 하진 않거든요.","source_cn":"毕竟您是守备军，是战士。真正的军人，应该像我们一样强壮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78C75C57D3C4C58D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721607011:1":{"text":"솔직히 근위대랑은 안 어울리는 모습이죠!","source_cn":"你这样子，可没有一点守备军的模样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0230132F0070471","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721607012:1":{"text":"근위대와 어울리는 모습? 너희처럼 편견만 가득하고 무례함으로 무능을 감추는 것이 근위대의 기준이라는 말인가?","source_cn":"守备军的模样？你是说，像你们这样满嘴偏见、只会用粗鲁来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21E95E212DB6A1C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721607013:2":{"text":"이익...! 누, 누가 무능하다고...! 분대장 달았다고 뭐, 무서워할 줄 압니까?!","source_cn":"你——！说谁无能？！别以为你是队长我们就怕你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5FA608C19D58570","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721607014:1":{"text":"사령관님 덕분에 그 자리에 앉은 주제에! 지금 근위대가 뭔지 가르치려고 드는 겁니까?","source_cn":"你不就是靠着你父亲才坐上这个位置的吗？还敢教训我们什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21DF520B71C89AE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1721607015:1":{"text":"그렇게 자신 있다면 한번 보여주시죠? 설마 아끼는 인형이 망가질까 봐 겁이라도 나신 건...","source_cn":"既然队长这么自信，不如让我们见识一下？还是说，您怕弄坏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DE50C2AB865FEA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721607016:1":{"text":"좋아, 너희가 근위대라는 직책에 큰 오해를 하고 있는 모양이니... 친히 가르쳐 주지. 시간 아까우니까 같이 덤벼.","source_cn":"很好。既然你们对守备军这个词有这么大的误解，那我就免费...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34B25351A41EBB4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1721607017:1":{"text":"분명 먼저 말씀하신 겁니다? 나중에 쪽수로 밀어붙였다고 울지나 마시죠!","source_cn":"这可是你自找的！别怪我们以多欺少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15F729AD92210590","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军盖伊":{"text":"근위대원 가이","source":"守备军盖伊","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军呼伦":{"text":"근위대원 호른","source":"守备军呼伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}}